  "packaging_boundary": "Version 1.3.0 adds the snapshot-applicability-check capability. The functional handoff freshness checker remains v1.2, the snapshot applicability checker is v1.0, and the resolver and handoff-card base components remain the unchanged already-public Yumi continuity v1.1 capability. Version 1.2.3 changed native-skill task-fit selection framing; version 1.2.2 documented one observed Codex compatibility check; version 1.2.1 added native-skill packaging. Both checkers package and reuse the base components; neither is independent validation. Immutable base code metadata may retain the earlier noqt/noqt origin documentation URL.",
