  "claim_boundary": "READY means required-key consistency only within the supplied ledger. UNCHANGED from the handoff checker means the supplied ready card matches a newly resolved supplied ledger; card digest claims remain unauthenticated. UNCHANGED from snapshot_check means only that the supplied scope, exact settings key set, and typed JSON values match the current READY ledger output. Neither result establishes truth, authenticated provenance, ledger freshness or completeness, permission, safety, task completion, intelligence, adoption, or savings."
